The colour schemes bundled in bin/themes.json are derived from
iTerm2-Color-Schemes, the same collection Ghostty's built-in themes come from:

    https://github.com/mbadolato/iTerm2-Color-Schemes

They are used under its MIT licence, reproduced below. Every bundled theme
keeps its original name, and any whose colours were altered to meet this
application's contrast floors is marked `adapted` in bin/themes.json, with the
altered tokens named — see tools/build-themes.py for exactly what was changed
and why.

